## SQ-HSC-89 | salt caves in the set biomes: raw rock salt shell (desert box of SQ-FCK-08)
@group A
@commands HNH-89: locate a salt cave, enter it
@pass generates in the set biomes; shell is raw rock salt block; logged for the further eval
@fails no cave, or a dissolving shell
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# a count box is at most 262144 blocks (64x64x64): the box runs as slices; the shell sums them per block and fails on no raw rock salt
